 any Rovo Dev features until the next billing cycle."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.breached.trials.need-to-know-list-admin-can-limit-usage":[{"type":0,"value":"Organization admins can adjust the extra usage limit or disable extra usage for when the paid plan starts — this can be done anytime in Atlassian Administration to keep costs predictable. "}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.breached.trials.need-to-know-list-extra-usage-charges":[{"type":0,"value":"If you want to allow extra usage before the trial ends, you can end the trial early and start the paid plan. If you do this, usage will reset and any usage over the allocated amount will be charged at USD 0.01 per extra Rovo Dev credit and added to the next invoice."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.breached.trialsneed-to-know-list-function-disabled":[{"type":0,"value":"Rovo Dev functionality is disabled for users who reach their allowance, and usage resets when the paid plan starts."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.need-to-know-list-extra-charges-in-invoice":[{"type":0,"value":"Once users exceed their allowance of Rovo Dev credits, extra usage will be charged at USD 0.01 per extra Rovo Dev credit — any extra charges will be added to your next invoice."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.need-to-know-list-monitor-usage":[{"type":0,"value":"It\'s a good idea to monitor usage in your billing account."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-reminder-ccp.message-template.email.body.need-to-know-list-org-admin-can-limit":[{"type":0,"value":"Organization admins can adjust the extra usage limit or disable extra usage anytime in Atlassian Administration to keep costs predictable."}],"commerce.commerce-rovo-dev-usage-limit-breach-rem